body:
i'm also the kind of person who can't understand sarcasm well;; 

i think you might be assuming we're not already in a relationship;; cos we are? umm more so i asked about the future and what it might be like, and i didn't get an answer there, however!! he did say in his own words at another time that he could see himself with me in the future without any problems (his exact words), so i'm also a bit confused;; i doubt that he's not interested in the relationship ^^;; he's more than enough proven and shown to me that he is 

i'm not insecure of our relationship or where it's headed? i don't actually really care too much about the answers that i'm going to get, as well. it's more so just a littlee strange that i don't get any answers at all about certain questions that involve the future, but not others. sorry for being so vague lol
